### Create high-value claim
POST http://localhost:8080/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policyNumber": "POL-00001",
  "customerNumber": "CUS-00001",
  "customerName": "Rahul Sharma",
  "incidentType": "ACCIDENT",
  "claimAmount": 800000,
  "status": "SUBMITTED",
  "riskScore": 0,
  "fraudScore": 0,
  "decision": "PENDING"
}